# robonix/service/navigation/amap_goal — start an AMap-assisted A->B task.
# Destination: pass dest_gcj02 ("lon,lat", GCJ02) OR dest_address (geocoded
# server-side). confirm_medium_energy = user approved medium-energy segments
# (crossings/bridges) for this task (design 4.3 energy gating).
string dest_gcj02
string dest_address
bool confirm_medium_energy
---
bool accepted
string task_id
string route_summary
string detail
